(2) Violation of any laws, ordinances or resolutions regarding such business or violation of regulations made pursuant to authority granted by the purpose of regulating such business;
(3) A licensee supplies false information to the Code Enforcement Officer, building official, his or her deputies, any Sheriff's deputy, police officer or the County Clerk, regardless of when the false information is discovered;
(4) The licensee has failed to obtain or has suffered the expiration, suspension or revocation of any paper or document by any officer, agency, authority or department of the county, State of Georgia, any other state or the United States under authority of any law, ordinance or resolution of the county, State of Georgia, any other state or the United States regulating such business; or
